OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. A few
OL,7,Fshowers will develop, some heavy in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon over southern and
OL,9,Fwestern counties.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers soon dying out,
OL,12,Fotherwise a dry evening with sunny
OL,13,Fspells. Skies becoming mostly clear
OL,14,Fovernight in the east but cloudier
OL,15,Fwith the odd shower in the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith the best of the sunny spells in
OL,19,Fthe east. Cloudier across the north
OL,20,Fand west with a few light showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
